{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "fr",
  "language_raw": "French",
  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_g_05.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_g_05.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_01",
      "hash64": "C5686982928EFF85",
      "text": "Bonjour. Je pense que vous savez désormais\\nqu’il est temps de ranger vos téléphones.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_02",
      "hash64": "C5686682928EFA6C",
      "text": "Même si certains d’entre vous ont dû repasser\\nle contrôle partiel, je suis fier de dire que\\r\\nvous avez globalement très bien réussi ![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 135,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_03",
      "hash64": "C5686782928EFC1F",
      "text": "Je suis particulièrement honoré de voir que vous\\nintégrez les compétences et les connaissances\\r\\nque j’essaie de vous enseigner dans mon cours.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 144,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_04",
      "hash64": "C5686482928EF706",
      "text": "J’espère que vous continuerez ces efforts\\nlors de la seconde partie du programme.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_05",
      "hash64": "C5686582928EF8B9",
      "text": "En attendant, permettez-moi d’éclaircir un point\\nsur les Auras Gustatives, car l’un d’entre vous\\r\\nm’a interrogé à ce sujet.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_06",
      "hash64": "C5686282928EF3A0",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, c’est un jeune homme passionné\\nde cuisine qui m’a posé cette question.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_07",
      "hash64": "C5686382928EF553",
      "text": "Il m’a dit passer beaucoup de temps à étudier\\nla cuisine de son côté.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_08",
      "hash64": "C5687082928F0B6A",
      "text": "Il prête une grande attention aux ingrédients\\nqu’il utilise dans ses recettes, et il se renseigne\\r\\nsur l’art culinaire nuit et jour.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_09",
      "hash64": "C5687182928F0D1D",
      "text": "Pourtant, il m’a avoué être désespéré de ne pas\\nparvenir à obtenir de meilleures Auras Gustatives.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_10",
      "hash64": "C56BEE829292175B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], vu les résultats que tu as\\nobtenus au contrôle, je pense que c’est toi\\r\\nque je vais interroger.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_11",
      "hash64": "C56BED82929215A8",
      "text": "À ton avis, que devrait faire Pe... Ahem... Je veux\\ndire, ce garçon, pour améliorer ses plats ?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "49BD8383383A8598",
      "text": "Cuisiner plus souvent.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "49BD8683383A8AB1",
      "text": "Cuisiner avec d’autres personnes.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "49BD8583383A88FE",
      "text": "Vous parlez de Pepper ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "FC75046691760666",
      "text": "La cuisine est un art aussi subtil que complexe...\\c\\nEt malheureusement, une pratique assidue n’est\\nparfois pas suffisante pour parvenir à ses fins.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 149,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "FC750366917604B3",
      "text": "Excellente réponse ! Je vois que tu comprends\\naisément ce qui fait l’essence des arts culinaires.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "FC75026691760300",
      "text": "Hum... Désolé, mais je ne peux rien dire de plus,\\nsi ce n’est que ce garçon aime beaucoup cuisiner.\\c\\nCela pourrait bien être Pepper, mais cela pourrait\\ntout aussi bien être quelqu’un d’autre...[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_12",
      "hash64": "C56BF08292921AC1",
      "text": "L’essentiel, afin d’obtenir de meilleures Auras\\nGustatives, est d’intégrer une grande variété\\r\\nd’ingrédients dans vos Sandwichs.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 130,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_13",
      "hash64": "C56BEF829292190E",
      "text": "Cela peut être délicat pour une seule personne.\\c\\nMais si plusieurs personnes s’attellent à la tâche,\\nil semble également logique que le pain utilisé\\r\\npour préparer le Sandwich soit plus grand.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 196,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_14",
      "hash64": "C56BF28292921E27",
      "text": "Et bien entendu, plus le pain que l’on utilise est\\ngrand, plus on peut y mettre d’ingrédients.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_15",
      "hash64": "C56BF18292921C74",
      "text": "C’est ainsi que l’on obtient de meilleures\\nAuras Gustatives : en cuisinant à plusieurs ![VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_16",
      "hash64": "C56BF4829292218D",
      "text": "Mais vous savez... Il y a une leçon encore\\nplus grande à en tirer.\\c\\nQuand une situation difficile se présente,\\nplutôt que de l’affronter de manière isolée,\\r\\nc’est toujours mieux de faire appel aux autres.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 157,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 208,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_17",
      "hash64": "C56BF38292921FDA",
      "text": "Je suis certain que Pepper ne manquera pas\\nd’essayer de cuisiner avec ses amis, maintenant.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_18",
      "hash64": "C56BE682929209C3",
      "text": "Euh... Pepper ou n’importe qui d’autre. Ce n’était\\nqu’un exemple. Et je compte garder l’identité\\r\\ndu jeune homme secrète, alors n’insistez pas.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_g_05_home_19",
      "hash64": "C56BE58292920810",
      "text": "Sur ce, notre leçon est désormais terminée.\\nJe vous souhaite une bonne journée.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
